# Analytics (Story 1.0a scaffold, completed by Story 8.3 — a real key is a
# drop-in with zero code changes: provider mounts, autocapture + manual
# screen tracking + before_send PII redaction all activate).
# Empty/missing key = analytics no-op (console fallback in dev builds).
# NOTE: EXPO_PUBLIC_* vars are inlined at Metro bundle time — restart Metro
# (or rebuild the APK) after changing them.
EXPO_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_API_KEY=
EXPO_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_HOST=https://eu.i.posthog.com

# Backend API base URL (Story 5.1). Unset = platform default:
# Android emulator → http://10.0.2.2:3000 (host loopback), else http://localhost:3000.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=

# Supabase auth (Story 5.2). Unset = the local stack defaults:
# URL → http://10.0.2.2:54321 on the Android emulator (else http://127.0.0.1:54321),
# anon key → the publicly-known supabase-local demo constant.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
